# Outfit head (R18): night goggles strapped over the voxel head; the lenses glow in the picked accent glow.
# Head frame: the pivot matches body_head (Offset X=1,Z=-6 on the head bone), the head fills x 1..6, y 1..5, z 0..5.
name outfit_goggles
grid 5
size 7 6 5
slot strap SwatchAccent
slot frame Steel
slot lens SwatchGlow
box 0 0 3 7 6 4 strap
carve box 1 1 3 6 5 4
box 6 0 1 7 6 4 frame
box 6 0 1 7 2 3 lens
box 6 4 1 7 6 3 lens
pivot 3 3 0
